# Copy to /root/gwan/gwan-site/.env (the compose env_file). Do not commit the real file.
#
# Required. Secret. Resend API key for the contact form.
RESEND_API_KEY=
#
# Optional. Not a secret. Verified sender. Defaults to noreply@gwan.dev.
# RESEND_FROM_EMAIL=noreply@gwan.dev
#
# Do not set NEXT_PUBLIC_GA_ID here. Next inlines it at image build from the
# GitHub Actions repository variable NEXT_PUBLIC_GA_ID (a GA4 id such as
# G-XXXXXXXX). This file is read by the running container and cannot change
# the browser tag. Leave that variable unset to ship with Google Analytics off.
# Do not set VERCEL. That turns on Vercel Analytics beacons, which 404 here,
# and it is also the switch that keeps Google Analytics off Vercel previews.
# Do not change PORT. Caddy proxies to gwan-site:3000.
